silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_02_membership_arrow_concrete_anchors#householdenrolmentarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseholdEnrolmentArrow is the typed enrolment arrow colim D_e -> colim D_Household; concretely the residency-classification of Mittens or Pumpkin as a resident of 77 Maple Street. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'member_of', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
