silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_02_membership_arrow_concrete_anchors#mittensresident silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensResident is the Mittens sub-apex enrolled as a resident; Mittens the individual cat at 77 Maple Street. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
